# Deployment Configuration

## Deployment Type
Local deployment using Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets.

## Configuration Steps
1. Clone or download the GitHub repository.
2. Download the Excel workbook.
3. Open the workbook using Microsoft Excel.
4. Navigate to the Formula Practice worksheet.
5. Modify the yellow input cells to test the formulas.
6. Review the Formula Notes worksheet for explanations.

## Hosting
No server or cloud deployment is required.

## Dependencies
No external libraries or software packages are required.

## Output
An interactive Excel workbook that demonstrates common Excel formulas using the Sample Superstore dataset.

## Compatibility
Microsoft Excel is recommended for formula compatibility. Some functions may not work in older spreadsheet versions.
